      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ba6bdca0e8a43959e6fd41a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她用老奶奶的智慧惊艳了中山庆典。\n之后也在游戏中学到了\n各种攻防技巧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f39c7701150132f2e66a0707faef3900006d1ed6e4fab68860010493cddeae3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b68cc88241efa5a4eb3d94a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我正想要成为她的助力，\n要是还反过来收她的钱，我哪有脸见人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be7bc5f18c1a5ff99bcf20676ae45f8bad681b9ea3b3fe2d7be48d084b9f0015",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46cfc2181b5add61b154a3dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不论是从特雷森学园还是一般社会的规矩来看，\n我都不该收下。\n我向奇锐骏如此说明后……",
      "source_fingerprint": "679bd44696fb921ce656fc64458c341ef747435e6efc3834a0762134419aa4ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
